        Beamforming in the Reproducing <span class="search-hit mathjax">Kernel</span> Domain Based on Spatial Differentiation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Iwami%2C+T">Takahiro Iwami</a>, 
      
