      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Abstract</span>:
      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2510.25855v2-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        We show that the heat kernel measures based at the north pole of the spheres $S^{N-1}(\sqrt N)$, with properly scaled radius $\sqrt N$ and adjusted center, converge to a Gaussian measure in $\mathbb R^\infty$, and find an explicit formula for this measure.
        
      </span>
      <span class="abstract-full has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2510.25855v2-abstract-full" style="display: none;">
        We show that the heat kernel measures based at the north pole of the spheres $S^{N-1}(\sqrt N)$, with properly scaled radius $\sqrt N$ and adjusted center, converge to a Gaussian measure in $\mathbb R^\infty$, and find an explicit formula for this measure.
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2510.25855v2-abstract-full').style.display = 'none'; document.getElementById('2510.25855v2-abstract-short').style.display = 'inline';">&#9651; Less</a>
      </span>
    </p>
    

    <p class="is-size-7"><span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Submitted</span> 4 November, 2025; <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">v1</span> submitted 29 October, 2025;
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">originally announced</span> October 2025.
      
    </p>
    

    

    
  </li>

  <li class="arxiv-result">
    <div class="is-marginless">
      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.25600">arXiv:2510.25600</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.25600">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2510.25600">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2510.25600">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
      </p>
      <div class="tags is-inline-block">
